        contentKo: "**숲속얘기군 과 야미양 이 결혼해요 !!**\n**** \n**언제 ???**     2006년 **11월 4일(토)** 늦은 **5**시 !!\n**어디서 ???**  4호선 범계역 3번출구 그랑펠리스 웨딩홀 [http://www.grandpalace.co.kr](http://www.grandpalace.co.kr/)\n\nsetSlidePhoto2View(\"0\", \"2\", \"550\", \"413\", \"http%3a%2f%2fblogfiles.naver.net%2fdata19%2f2006%2f10%2f17%2f282%2f%ed%81%ac%ea%b8%b0%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98_IMGP9117_filtered-fstory_yahmi.jpg|http%3a%2f%2fblogfiles.naver.net%2fdata18%2f2006%2f10%2f17%2f203%2f%ed%81%ac%ea%b8%b0%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98_IMGP9068_filtered-fstory_yahmi.jpg|http%3a%2f%2fblogfiles.naver.net%2fdata19%2f2006%2f10%2f17%2f178%2f%ed%81%ac%ea%b8%b0%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98_IMGP9178_filtered-fstory_yahmi.jpg|http%3a%2f%2fblogfiles.naver.net%2fdata18%2f2006%2f10%2f17%2f253%2f%ed%81%ac%ea%b8%b0%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98_IMGP8915_filtered-fstory_yahmi.jpg|http%3a%2f%2fblogfiles.naver.net%2fdata18%2f2006%2f10%2f17%2f117%2f%ed%81%ac%ea%b8%b0%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98_IMGP9041_filtered-fstory_yahmi.jpg\");\n \n**공지1.** **아래를 클릭하시면 저희들의 초대장 을 보실 수 있구요.(약도도 있음)**\n[http://www.thecard.co.kr/eWed/swf/eW0008/main.swf?view_mode=screen_tmp&order_num=6703](http://www.thecard.co.kr/eWed/swf/eW0008/main.swf?view_mode=screen_tmp&order_num=6703)http://www.thecard.co.kr/eWed/swf/eW0008/main.swf?view_mode=screen_tmp&order_num=6703\n \n**공지2.** 방명록은 **블로그**에 남겨주세요.\n블로그의 포토로그에는 저희 결혼사진을 공개하고 있습니다.\n[http://blog.naver.com/fstory_yahmi](http://blog.naver.com/fstory_yahmi)http://blog.naver.com/fstory_yahmihttp://blog.naver.com/fstory_yahmihttp://blog.naver.com/fstory_yahmihttp://blog.naver.com/fstory_yahmihttp://blog.naver.com/fstory_yahmi",
